sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Desk as Hospital desk
  participant HAPI as hospital-api
  participant N8N as hospital n8n
  participant DP as doc-pipeline + vision
  participant HC as Hospital crew (CrewAI)
  actor BO as Billing officer
  participant IAPI as insurer-api
  participant IC as Insurer crew (CrewAI)
  participant CALC as calc-engine
  participant BANK as tpa-sim (bank)
  Desk->>HAPI: create case, upload PDFs
  HAPI->>N8N: document uploaded (webhook)
  N8N->>DP: OCR, classify, mask PII, extract fields
  DP-->>HAPI: typed fields per document
  HAPI->>N8N: checklist complete
  N8N->>HC: claim-build job
  HC->>HC: ClaimFlow: build lines and totals, estimate admissible amount
  HC-->>HAPI: claim draft and estimate
  BO->>HAPI: review, sign off, submit
  HAPI->>IAPI: signed claim (HMAC, idempotency key)
  IAPI->>IC: identity, authenticity, coverage, bill mapping, supervisor
  IAPI->>CALC: payable amount (deterministic)
  IAPI->>IAPI: decision gate: auto / one approver / two approvers
  alt documents missing or unclear
    IAPI-->>HAPI: query (round 1-3)
    HAPI->>HC: QueryFlow: triage, grounded reply draft
    BO->>HAPI: approve reply
    HAPI->>IAPI: reply and documents
  end
  IAPI-->>HAPI: decision callback
  IAPI->>BANK: payout
  BANK-->>IAPI: paid
  IAPI-->>HAPI: settled callback
  Note over HAPI,IAPI: both sides keep a hash-chained audit trail
